{"id":"0ec3e4391cca9764","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-simple-game.md","title":"简单集需求的可计算 BLUE 策略","display":"thm-simple-game — 简单集需求的可计算 BLUE 策略","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-simple-game","aliases":["20-thm-simple-game"],"display":"thm-simple-game — 简单集需求的可计算 BLUE 策略","chapter":"16","section":"16.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§16.3.1","source_pdf_pages":[251],"source_printed_pages":[223],"depends_on":["[[20-df-lachlan-game]]","[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-thm-simple-exists]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-simple-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-simple-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simple-game — 简单集需求的可计算 BLUE 策略"},{"key":"chapter","html":"16"},{"key":"section","html":"16.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§16.3.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>251</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>223</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2772d51949360c14\" href=\"?note=2772d51949360c14\" title=\"20-df-lachlan-game\">20-df-lachlan-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" href=\"?note=0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" title=\"20-thm-simple-exists\">20-thm-simple-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>RED 每阶段给有限列枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 是全部这样的红方走法序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_e^r\">\\(U_e^r\\)</span> 为其最终第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 列。BLUE 只枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=V_0\">\\(A=V_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 表示全可计算历史动作函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2772d51949360c14\" href=\"?note=2772d51949360c14\" title=\"20-df-lachlan-game\">20-df-lachlan-game</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" href=\"?note=0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" title=\"20-thm-simple-exists\">20-thm-simple-exists</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:=\\mathcal F^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal P:=\\mathcal F^\\omega\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F:=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F:=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\\n[(\\forall s\\in\\omega\\ b_s^f(r)\\subseteq\\{0\\}\\times\\omega)\\land|\\omega\\setminus A^{f,r}|=\\omega\\land\n\\forall e\\ (|U_e^r|=\\omega\\Rightarrow U_e^r\\cap A^{f,r}\\ne\\varnothing)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\\n[(\\forall s\\in\\omega\\ b_s^f(r)\\subseteq\\{0\\}\\times\\omega)\\land|\\omega\\setminus A^{f,r}|=\\omega\\land\n\\forall e\\ (|U_e^r|=\\omega\\Rightarrow U_e^r\\cap A^{f,r}\\ne\\varnothing)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le s\">\\(e\\le s\\)</span>，每个要求记录“已经满足／已经为它枚举一次”。若尚未满足且当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_e\">\\(U_e\\)</span> 中有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2e\">\\(x&gt;2e\\)</span>，枚举一个这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 并停止该要求以后行动。所有记录可从有限历史重建，有限动作编码给一个全可计算 BLUE 函数；每阶段至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 个新动作。</p>\n<p>在初始区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,2n]\">\\([0,2n]\\)</span> 中，只有要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;n\">\\(e&lt;n\\)</span> 能贡献元素，每个至多贡献一个，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A\\cap[0,2n]|\\le n\">\\(|A\\cap[0,2n]|\\le n\\)</span>。至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个元素未被枚举，余集无限。若某 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_e^r\">\\(U_e^r\\)</span> 无限且尚未被击中，某阶段总能见到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2e\">\\(x&gt;2e\\)</span>，到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 已被处理时即击中。此组合论论证对任意红方有限走法序列成立；蓝列在非有效红方对局中不因此自动 c.e.。当 RED 统一可计算且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_e=W_e\">\\(U_e=W_e\\)</span> 时，蓝列 c.e. 并满足 simple 定义。</p>\n<p>来源：§16.3.1；印刷 223 / PDF 251。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-lachlan-game","status":"resolved","id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-lachlan-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-simple-exists","status":"resolved","id":"0ddc2f4aa380ea29","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-simple-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lachlan-game","status":"resolved","id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-simple-exists","status":"resolved","id":"0ddc2f4aa380ea29","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"U_e^r","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"A=V_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P:=\\mathcal F^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F:=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|<\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\\n[(\\forall s\\in\\omega\\ b_s^f(r)\\subseteq\\{0\\}\\times\\omega)\\land|\\omega\\setminus A^{f,r}|=\\omega\\land\n\\forall e\\ (|U_e^r|=\\omega\\Rightarrow U_e^r\\cap A^{f,r}\\ne\\varnothing)].","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"U_e","display":false},{"tex":"x>2e","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"[0,2n]","display":false},{"tex":"e<n","display":false},{"tex":"|A\\cap[0,2n]|\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"U_e^r","display":false},{"tex":"x>2e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"U_e=W_e","display":false}],"bytes":2220,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-462","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-simple-game]] — 章 16；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-462","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-simple-game]]"}],"outgoing":["2772d51949360c14","428fc565e7338639","0ddc2f4aa380ea29","e343870c773cb68e"]}